1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,352
For a stronger short film,

2
00:00:01,384 --> 00:00:02,281
start with a script

3
00:00:02,346 --> 00:00:03,329
you already have.

4
00:00:03,458 --> 00:00:04,464
Open your codebase

5
00:00:04,485 --> 00:00:07,900
and select GPT-6.2 Astra.

6
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,339
Ask Astra to read

7
00:00:09,397 --> 00:00:10,442
your project brief.

8
00:00:10,581 --> 00:00:11,522
Who is the audience,

9
00:00:11,545 --> 00:00:12,520
and what should they do

10
00:00:12,601 --> 00:00:13,739
at the end?

11
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,644
One line in our old script

12
00:00:16,691 --> 00:00:18,687
says, “Camera neeche lao.”

13
00:00:19,001 --> 00:00:20,406
That’s a shot direction.

14
00:00:20,603 --> 00:00:22,577
Move it into the shot list.

15
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,244
Then ask Astra:

16
00:00:24,291 --> 00:00:25,870
Keep the strongest opening.

17
00:00:26,032 --> 00:00:27,158
Cut repeated lines.

18
00:00:27,205 --> 00:00:28,644
Match each line to a shot.

19
00:00:28,679 --> 00:00:30,212
End with one clear action.

20
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,049
Play the rewrite

21
00:00:32,084 --> 00:00:33,024
over your footage.

22
00:00:33,291 --> 00:00:34,440
Agar line cut ke baad

23
00:00:34,499 --> 00:00:35,195
bhi chal rahi hai,

24
00:00:35,218 --> 00:00:36,298
shorten the sentence

25
00:00:36,344 --> 00:00:37,900
and preview again.

26
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,236
Try this workflow

27
00:00:40,352 --> 00:00:41,060
with the skills

28
00:00:41,118 --> 00:00:42,337
in your own codebase,

29
00:00:42,395 --> 00:00:43,730
using Astra.

30
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:45,446
Main apna repo link,

31
00:00:45,481 --> 00:00:47,258
five reference repos aur skills

32
00:00:47,316 --> 00:00:48,813
aapko DM karunga.

33
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,497
Aapko bhi aisi short story

34
00:00:50,532 --> 00:00:51,658
banani hai aur zyada

35
00:00:51,704 --> 00:00:52,401
views chahiye?

36
00:00:52,494 --> 00:00:53,840
Please comment “story”.
